          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Many parents think that waiting until children are older is the best approach when it comes to \"tricky\" topics. But in today's world, kids are exposed to similar ideas at a young age through social media, video, and even teachers.<br/><br/>Helping kids explore ideas and think critically while they are young is crucial. Tuttle Twins makes it easy.</p>",
