        "text_iWUXJn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It can be a struggle at times—getting the family in the same room and having a discussion together. It can be hard feeling like the institutions in our  society are trying to undermine your efforts by broadcasting messages to your children that you disagree with.<br/><br/>You can facilitate family discussions about powerful ideas and current events and shield your children from harmful ideas they will be exposed to. Through engaging story adventures and activity pages we will provide, you will empower your kids to learn about your values—and what it means for their young lives in today’s world.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
